{{Skill infobox|id=ThirstForBlood}}

'''Thirst for Blood''' is a [[reservation]] [[skill]] granted by {{il|Jack, the Axe}}. It [[Reservation|reserve]]s 10% [[life]] and grants 20% [[more]] damage with [[bleed]]ing. It attaches a beam to nearby bleeding enemies, granting a large amount of flat life [[regeneration]] for each enemy affected by the beam.

==Sources==
{{il|Jack, the Axe}} grants the Level 20 version of the skill.

